                                <string key="text">I am a passionate software developer and 3D visualizer with a strong focus on creating immersive user experiences. With expertise in Swift, UI design, and interactive 360-degree rendering, I love bringing creative ideas to life. When I am not coding or designing, you can find me exploring the mountains, tweaking my custom PC build, or enjoying a good sci-fi movie. I am always open to exciting new projects and collaborations. Let's build something amazing together!</string>
